        renderBodyMetrics, deriveFigureRegions, bodyFigureSvg, mergeLatestSites, mergePreviousSites,
        bmReferencePhysique, bmReferenceWeightLb, bmStandModel, bmStandFigureSvg, bmSiteRead, bmResolveSelected,
